{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月23日，財經雜誌報道稱，杭州娃哈哈集團有限公司法定代表人、董事長兼總經理許思敏已於近日辭職。有接近娃哈哈人士向新浪財經透露，該消息屬實。一名正在與娃哈哈集團進行勞動糾紛訴訟的老員工表示：「接到該案所屬中級人民法院的電話，由於娃哈哈集團法定代表人辭職了，案子開庭日期將變更」。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583506.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.946790+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:20:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:23.291224+00:00","content_hash":"2b587f891fe0cf9b6fec3848859f0b5a601d25b3bf073f3a308c1a85995910d3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}